OL,3,GNEWSAI found love at an Irish
OL,4,Amatchmaking festival - and I want
OL,5,Aothers to do the same
OL,6,
OL,7,FMary Timby was fed up with dating apps
OL,8,Fwhen she booked a trip to Ireland on a
OL,9,Fwhim last summer - from the comfort of
OL,10,Fher Colorado couch.
OL,12,FThe spur-of-the-moment trip was unlike
OL,13,Fher: Timby, 39, is a self-described
OL,14,F"total planner".
OL,16,FBut she'd always wanted to visit
OL,17,FIreland, and she found herself
OL,18,Fexhausted by the local dating scene
OL,19,Fwhile navigating a career transition.
OL,20,FAnd then she remembered a few throwaway
OL,21,Flines from a comedy series about a
OL,22,Fmatchmaking festival in Ireland.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
