OL,3,GNEWSAI found love at an Irish
OL,4,Amatchmaking festival - and I want
OL,5,Aothers to do the same
OL,6,
OL,7,FSo she looked it up - and not only was
OL,8,Fthe Lisdoonvarna Matchmaking Festival
OL,9,Freal, it was also taking place during
OL,10,Fthe entire month of September, when she
OL,11,Fwas scheduled to visit.
